{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"MGASA-2026-0594","published":"2026-11-12T22:40:23Z","modified":"2026-11-12T22:45:03.248808170Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-51105"],"summary":"Updated amule packages fix security vulnerabilities","details":"A security release first: it fixes 15 vulnerabilities reported through\nGitHub Security Advisories, and 11 of them are also present in aMule\n2.3.3. If you still run 2.3.x or any 3.x release, please upgrade. The\nrelease is 455 merged PRs on top of 3.1.0, including the 12 advisory\nfixes merged at release time. Around those fixes: uploads that no longer\nstall behind a slow disk, new downloads that find sources sooner, an\n\"All\" search across eD2k and Kad, chat spam protection everywhere, an\nappearance setting, connection-state tray icons on Linux, and the Web UI\nin seven languages.\nUpgrading is a drop-in, but a few defaults changed for safety. Read\nhttps://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases#before-you-upgrade if you\ndrive aMule from a remote GUI, amuleapi, amuleweb or scripts.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"amule","ecosystem":"Mageia:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/mageia/amule?arch=source&distro=mageia-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2.0-1.1.mga10"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"section":"core"},"database_specific":{"source":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0594.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2026-0594.html"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugs.mageia.org/show_bug.cgi?id=36694"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases#release-3.2.0"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases#release-3.1.0"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases#release-3.0.1"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/amule-org/amule/releases#release-3.0.0"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/amule-org/amule/security/advisories/GHSA-cp82-q55r-936c"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://gi